                                "sense_id": "15dee32e-454c-3b4c-9775-019aa5a5f40f",
                                "text": "A correlation may be observed between the subjects studied in the masonic assemblies and those discussed in the Radical and Radical-Socialist party congresses: between 1901 and 1910 these subjects included state laicity, [...]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0968f0e9-c857-461b-a56c-fefcd87f0ecc",
                                "sense_id": "15dee32e-454c-3b4c-9775-019aa5a5f40f",
                                "text": "This shows that there can be laicity even where there is no formal separation [of Church and State]."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3b8351b6-aae7-467b-8c13-f82ec44f51da",
                                "sense_id": "15dee32e-454c-3b4c-9775-019aa5a5f40f",
                                "text": "In this sense, there is no doubt that the concept of laicity has been tremendously useful."
